<title>USA: Hain Food acquires Boston Popcorn.</title>
<headline>Hain Food acquires Boston Popcorn.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hain Food Group Inc said Tuesday that it had acquired Boston Popcorn Co on Friday.</p>
<p>Irwin Simon, Hain's president and chief executive officer, said Hain's distribution channels should increase Boston Popcorn's &quot;sales well beyond current levels.&quot;</p>
<p>The purchase price was not announced.</p>
<p>Boston Popcorn manufactures, markets and sells a quality line of popcorn products, low-fat potato chips and other snack items.</p>
<p>Hain Food Group, headquartered in Uniondale, N.Y., is a specialty food company.</p>
</text>
